      "content": "but that's just a pretty way of saying \"keep going.\" i don't want to fill the space with more questions. i'm just so tired of the struggle to find meaning where there clearly isn't any. it feels like i've been running a race that doesn't actually have a finish line, just a cliff. it's not just a \"phase\" or a \"shift\"... it's the truth. everything i thought was solid is just gone.",
